  "summary_en": "Random Mono generates random values for a mono layer, VDB or attribute. By default the Seed-driven selection fills the whole layer, and per-pixel randomness creates fine, grain-like noise. Values can come from a Min/Max range, a Float Ramp or a Specific Values list.",
